u will not need )TjT* 0 Tc (to click on the Detect button located at the bottom of the form. )Tj0 -19 TD (If you want to change more than one parameter before detecting, choose )Tj0 -12 TD (Manual. With the Manual option, you can change parameter settings \336rst, )TjT* (and then apply them by clicking the Detect button.)TjETendstreamendobj1440 0 obj2333endobj1438 0 obj<</Type /Page/Parent 1402 0 R/Resources <</Font <</F4 16 0 R /F6 20 0 R /F7 25 0 R /F12 82 0 R >>/ProcSet 2 0 R>>/Contents 1439 0 R>>endobj1442 0 obj<</Length 1443 0 R>>stream
