critical if a few pixels are omitted from the band. )Tj/F7 11 Tf0 Tc -9 -27.5 TD (Minimum Density )Tj/F6 10 Tf9 -20.5 TD (When Normalization is turned off, this is the lowest signal intensity value )Tj0 -12 TD (that will be counted as a band.)Tj0 -20 TD -0.018 Tc (Before entering a value for Min. Density, use the Lane > Plot Lane command )Tj0 -12 TD 0 Tc -0.285 Tw (to plot a trace of a lane that includes some faint bands. Then enter a value that )TjT* 0 Tw (is lower than the intensity of the peak of a faint band but is still above the )TjT* (background.)TjETendstreamendobj1447 0 obj2575endobj1444 0 obj<</Type /Page/Parent 1445 0 R/Resources <</Font <</F4 16 0 R /F6 20 0 R /F7 25 0 R >>/ProcSet 2 0 R>>/Contents 1446 0 R>>endobj1449 0 obj<</Length 1450 0 R>>stream
