ter instead of the Noise )Tj0 -12 TD 0 Tc -0.397 Tw (Filter to improve the detection of closely-spaced bands. Be wary of decreasing )TjT* 0 Tw (both the Noise Filter and the Size Scale, as this may result in the fuzziness )TjT* (around bands being mistakenly detected as separate bands.)Tj/F7 11 Tf-9 -27.5 TD (Shoulder Sensitivity)Tj/F6 10 Tf9 -20.5 TD -0.015 Tc (Normally, band detection tries to distinguish shoulders as separate bands. )Tj0 -12 TD 0 Tc (When looking at a lane trace, these bands appear as \337at or gently sloping )TjT* -0.015 Tc (abutments to darker, better-de\336ned bands \(i.e., there is no dip on the trace )TjT* 0 Tc (between the two bands\).)TjETendstreamendobj1450 0 obj2686endobj1448 0 obj<</Type /Page/Parent 1445 0 R/Resources <</Font <</F1 7 0 R /F4 16 0 R /F6 20 0 R /F7 25 0 R >>/ProcSet 2 0 R>>/Contents 1449 0 R>>endobj1452 0 obj<</Length 1453 0 R>>stream
