\))Tj0 -20 TD (The Database Summary form is the on-screen representation of the database )Tj0 -12 TD (\336le. Using the Summary form, you can open six main database dialog boxes: )TjT* (the Gels list, the Gel Layout form, the Samples list, the Band Sets form, the )TjT* (Searches form, and the Populations form.)TjETendstreamendobj1864 0 obj2322endobj1861 0 obj<</Type /Page/Parent 1862 0 R/Resources <</Font <</F4 16 0 R /F6 20 0 R /F7 25 0 R /F12 82 0 R >>/ProcSet 2 0 R>>/Contents 1863 0 R>>endobj1866 0 obj<</Length 1867 0 R>>stream
