 Database database starts with a single gel image. You begin )Tj0 -12 TD 0 Tc (building the database by identifying and matching the unique bands in that )TjT* (gel\321these matched bands are called band types.)TjETendstreamendobj3195 0 obj2219 endobj3196 0 obj[ /PDF /Text ]endobjxref0 2 0000000053 65535 f
